1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,833
People often say the heart
had to be lighter than the feather.

2
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:07,467
Here, the heart is not shown
lighter than the feather.

3
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:10,100
The two sides hang in balance.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:14,000
Museum descriptions speak
of the heart balancing with Maat,

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,667
truth and right order.
